<p>Starting <strong>January 1, 2026</strong>, a quiet rule change in Nigerian tax law took effect. It got very little press coverage. Most Nigerian accountants have not mentioned it to their clients yet.</p>

<p>If you run a Nigerian business, whether you sell off Instagram DMs or operate a ₦1B revenue fintech, this post will give you one specific piece of knowledge: <strong>what changed, who is affected, and what smart operators are doing right now to stay completely out of the way.</strong></p>

<p>No fear mongering. No "your business is doomed." Just the information that puts you a few months ahead of everyone else.</p>

